   }\n\n    .entry:nth-child(n+10) .text-box {\n      top: 2px;\n      min-height: 111px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 540px) {\n      body {\n        justify-content: flex-start;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        flex: 0 0 540px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"title\">金陵十二钗正册判词</header>\n\n    <section class=\"entries\">\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：林黛玉]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">林黛玉（情情）</span>\n          可叹停机德，<br>\n          堪怜咏絮才。<br>\n          玉带林中挂，<br>\n          金簪雪里埋。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：薛宝钗]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">薛宝钗（无情）</span>\n          可叹停机德，<br>\n          堪怜咏絮才。<br>\n          玉带林中挂，<br>\n          金簪雪里埋。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：王熙凤]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">王熙凤（情雄）</span>\n          凡鸟偏从末世来，<br>\n          都知爱慕此生才。<br>\n          一从二令三人木，<br>\n          哭向金陵事更哀。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：贾元春]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">贾元春（情尊）</span>\n          二十年来辨是非，<br>\n          榴花开处照宫闱。<br>\n          三春争及初春景，<br>\n          虎兕相逢大梦归。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：贾迎春]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">贾迎春（情懦）</span>\n          子系中山狼，<br>\n          得志便猖狂。<br>\n          金闺花柳质，<br>\n          一载赴黄粱。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：贾探春]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">贾探春（情敏）</span>\n          才自精明志自高，<br>\n          生于末世运偏消。<br>\n          清明涕送江边望，<br>\n          千里东风一梦遥。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：贾惜春]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">贾惜春（情冷）</span>\n          堪破三春景不长，<br>\n          缁衣顿改昔年妆。<br>\n          可怜绣户侯门女，<br>\n          独卧青灯古佛旁。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：史湘云]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">史湘云（情憨）</span>\n          富贵又何为？<br>\n          襁褓之间父母违。<br>\n          展眼吊斜晖，<br>\n          湘江水逝楚云飞。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：秦可卿]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">秦可卿（情孽）</span>\n          情天情海幻情身，<br>\n          情既相逢必主淫。<br>\n          漫言不肖皆荣出，<br>\n          造衅开端实在宁。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：妙玉]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">妙玉（情隐）</span>\n          欲洁何曾洁？<br>\n          云空未必空。<br>\n          可怜金玉质，<br>\n          终陷淖泥中。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：贾巧姐]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">贾巧姐（情缘）</span>\n          势败休云贵，<br>\n          家亡莫论亲。<br>\n          偶因济刘氏，<br>\n          巧得遇恩人。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[人物插图：李纨]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-box\">\n          <span class=\"name\">李纨（情槁）</span>\n          桃李春风结子完，<br>\n          到头谁似一盆兰。<br>\n          如冰水好空相妒，<br>\n          枉与他人作笑谈。\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
